 competencies", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [394.2861328125, 537.76171875, 422.2001953125, 570.65234375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [393.70458984375, 574.3294746215494, 533.25, 624.5107421875], "text": "Varied classroom activities and innovative assessments methods enable you to develop and apply subject knowledge", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [222.96357421875, 633.59677734375, 256.22783203125, 668.87197265625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [225.75, 670.5576171875, 362.25, 742.2796081923419], "text": "Beyond subject-specific knowledge, acquire transferable skills such as critical thinking, adaptability, and creativity, which are highly sought after by employers in today's job market", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [395.44921875, 539.8173828125, 423.36328125, 573.5302734375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [390.796875, 578.875, 525.71484375, 624.921875], "text": "", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [390.971337890625, 638.85927734375, 425.514990234375, 666.89853515625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [394.86767578125, 667.2685546875, 534.75, 742.2796081923419], "text": "Additional Double Major programmes offered in collaboration with other schools in the CoHASS to foster interdisciplinary perspectives and broaden your academic horizons", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [637.5, 135.673828125, 713.25, 150.474609375], "text": "SCHOOL OF", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [634.5, 153.3525390625, 1027.5, 175.44790739091718], "text": "SOCIAL SCIENCES (SSS@NTU) (", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [832.76953125, 160.341796875, 888.59765625, 173.498046875], "text": "", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [911.27783203125, 153.59326171875, 947.33349609375, 175.31298828125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [947.33349609375, 154.1748046875, 971.75830078125, 174.7314453125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [974.142626953125, 154.05146484375, 998.451123046875, 174.85478515625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [1000.0212890625, 155.77822265625, 1030.7267578125, 174.77255859375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [639.522802734375, 186.7365234375, 656.154931640625, 203.0173828125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [636.75, 208.85546875, 683.25, 220.43455031166516], "text": "ABOUT", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [634.5, 225.7119140625, 787.5, 409.0771484375], "text": "As an SSS@NTU undergraduate, you will gain insights from examining individuals, communities and societies, and focusing on their behaviours and interactions with one another. You can opt for a 4-year Direct Honours degree in Economics, Psychology, Public Policy &amp; Global Affairs, and Sociology, or choose a Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Economics and Data Science programme, a collaboration between SSS@NTU and two schools in NTU's College of Engineering &amp; College of Science.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [820.5, 192.8212890625, 941.25, 206.1887800534283], "text": "OUR ADVANTAGES", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [821.778369140625, 219.58603515625, 846.086865234375, 245.81630859375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [823.5, 249.5576171875, 942.75, 298.0712890625], "text": "Ranked 11th in the 2022 QS World University Rankings by Subject for Social Science Management", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [988.3904296875, 223.69736328125, 1019.0958984375, 249.92763671875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [985.71533203125, 250.42564559216385, 1123.5, 286.1484375], "text": "Establishing strong connections and research collaborations with international universities", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [823.2322265625, 314.14658203125, 853.9376953125, 340.37685546875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [822.75, 342.0625, 945.75, 391.38379341050756], "text": "Greater breadth of exposure and study via Double Degree, Second Majors, Double Majors, and Minors", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [984.377783203125, 314.96884765625, 1013.803857421875, 341.19912109375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [986.25, 345.6473731077471, 1105.5, 403.732421875], "text": "Unparalleled opportunities for collaboration, skill development, improved employability, and readiness for a global workforce", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [636.75, 449.779296875, 828.1171875, 467.869140625], "text": "WEE KIM WEE SCHOOL OF", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [631.5556640625, 464.9912109375, 1054.5, 515.846838824577], "text": "COMMUNICATION AND INFORMATION (WKWSCI) ( I I I I I I I I I I I I I I I I I I", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [862.137451171875, 501.8287109375, 919.710205078125, 514.4916015625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [928.02626953125, 491.6326171875, 956.17294921875, 511.5314453125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [962.91884765625, 491.6326171875, 991.06552734375, 511.5314453125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [995.48525390625, 492.90712890625, 1023.63193359375, 511.90146484375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [1023.63193359375, 494.9498046875, 1055.96572265625, 513.1478515625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [638.5341796875, 521.7275390625, 654.8173828125, 538.9951171875], "text": "", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [636.75, 547.62890625, 683.25, 559.3339269813], "text": "ABOUT", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [634.5, 567.5814781834372, 787.5, 719.786286731968], "text": "Designed to equip you with a strong balance of practical and conceptual skills, WKWSCI offers the most comprehensive curriculum in Communication Studies. The school offers a 4-year Direct Honours degree in Communication Studies, with tracks in Strategic Communication for the Digital Age, Broadcast Media and Cinema Studies, Data Science and Media Studies and Journalism and Media Policies.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [820.5, 532.005859375, 940.5, 545.162109375], "text": "OUR ADVANTAGES", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [821.25498046875, 560.08623046875, 844.28408203125, 584.50751953125], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [820.55712890625, 587.5087890625, 953.25, 660.6904296875], "text": "Ranked 1st in Asia and 6th in the World in the 2023 QS World University Rankings by Subject for Communication &amp; Media Studies", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [822.88330078125, 658.2236328125, 851.25, 687.5458593054318], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [823.5, 689.880859375, 953.25, 739.280498664292], "text": "Flexibility for you to specialise in one or more tracks, or develop yourself as a broadbased communication graduate", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [982.45869140625, 557.9072265625, 1015.72294921875, 585.0419921875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [984.55224609375, 591.5743544078362, 1125.75, 651.234375], "text": "International faculty, state-ofthe-art research laboratories and media production suites, and global institutional affiliations and partnerships", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [987.34365234375, 658.8814453125, 1015.49033203125, 689.6341796875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [985.5, 690.703125, 1127.25, 763.0625], "text": "Curriculum covers both traditional and new media content, designed to offer practice-based realworld learning opportunities in an industry setting, or through overseas experiences.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [38.96337890625, 808.260017809439, 1151.25, 821.8544921875], "text": "22 23", "type": "Text"}], "doc_id": "2024.ug.eprospectus.pdf", "page_index": 12, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/2024.ug.eprospectus.pdf", "source": "marker"}